.gitignore do cliente main - RF Online Legacy Eternal
Segredos e gerados ficam FORA do GitHub. O launcher.example.ini e o modelo publico.

# Credencial real do jogador/admin
launcher.ini

# Backups e logs
*.bak
*.bak_*
*.backup
*.backup_*
_*/
NetLog/*
!NetLog/.gitkeep
ScreenShots/*
!ScreenShots/.gitkeep
*.log
*.dmp

# Banco/estado local
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Launcher: segredo, cache e build
launcher/.github_token
launcher/.cache/
launcher/build/
launcher/dist/
launcher/*.spec

# Lixo de sistema
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
